'''Disturbed sand''' is found in the [[Hunter]] area west of the [[Ruins of Uzer]] and are used when [[tracking]] [[desert devil]]s. They are always found at the end of a desert devil trail, and must be attacked with a [[noose wand]] to catch the kebbit.

When searching the bush, there is a rare chance to find an [[old boot]].

